Subject: wined3d: support Direct3D 9 luminance formats on Vulkan
Date: 2026-10-13
Applies to: CrossOver 26.3.0 Wine sources, after 0006
Files changed: dlls/wined3d/utils.c

L8, L8A8 and L16 had no Vulkan format, so CreateTexture failed and games that
do not check the result, like BO1, crashed on the missing texture. They are
stored as R8, R8G8 and R16 with the channel remapping the OpenGL path uses
(XXX1, XXXY).

Test: tools/d3d9-format-test.c
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, like the Wine files it modifies.
---
diff --git a/dlls/wined3d/utils.c b/dlls/wined3d/utils.c
index 967ea27..15aba94 100644
--- a/dlls/wined3d/utils.c
+++ b/dlls/wined3d/utils.c
@@ -4160,6 +4160,9 @@ static void init_vulkan_format_info(struct wined3d_adapter *adapter, struct wine
         {WINED3DFMT_R8_SNORM,                   VK_FORMAT_R8_SNORM,                },
         {WINED3DFMT_R8_SINT,                    VK_FORMAT_R8_SINT,                 },
         {WINED3DFMT_A8_UNORM,                   VK_FORMAT_R8_UNORM,                "000X"},
+        {WINED3DFMT_L8_UNORM,                   VK_FORMAT_R8_UNORM,                "XXX1"},
+        {WINED3DFMT_L8A8_UNORM,                 VK_FORMAT_R8G8_UNORM,              "XXXY"},
+        {WINED3DFMT_L16_UNORM,                  VK_FORMAT_R16_UNORM,               "XXX1"},
         {WINED3DFMT_B8G8R8A8_UNORM,             VK_FORMAT_B8G8R8A8_UNORM,          },
         {WINED3DFMT_B8G8R8A8_UNORM_SRGB,        VK_FORMAT_B8G8R8A8_SRGB,           },
         {WINED3DFMT_B8G8R8X8_UNORM,             VK_FORMAT_B8G8R8A8_UNORM,          "XYZ1"},
